  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Add default sort config by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/88\r\n* Update ratatui to 0.30.0 by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/90\r\n* Add copying text in object preview by @paullj in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/91\r\n* Implement image copy in object preview by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/92\r\n* Update MSRV to 1.90.0\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @paullj made their first contribution in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/91\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lusingander/stu/compare/v0.7.5...v0.7.6",
